{'symbol': 'JNJ', 'date': '2023-01-18 16:30:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON & JOHNSON TO PARTICIPATE IN THE SVB SECURITIES GLOBAL BIOPHARMA CONFERENCE', 'text': 'NEW BRUNSWICK, N.J.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--JOHNSON & JOHNSON (NYSE: JNJ) WILL PARTICIPATE IN THE SVB SECURITIES GLOBAL BIOPHARMA CONFERENCE ON WEDNESDAY, FEBRUARY 15TH. BILJANA NAUMOVIC, WORLDWIDE VICE PRESIDENT, ONCOLOGY AND PETER LEBOWITZ, GLOBAL THERAPEUTIC HEAD, ONCOLOGY WILL REPRESENT THE COMPANY IN A VIRTUAL SESSION SCHEDULED AT 1:00 P.M. (EASTERN TIME).'}